🐳 Complete Docker Commands (Basic + Important)

| Command | Work (Description) |
| :--- | :--- |
| `docker pull ubuntu` | Ubuntu image download |
| `docker images` | All images show |
| `docker run ubuntu` | Ubuntu container run (quickly exit ho jayega) |
| `docker run -it ubuntu bash` | Ubuntu terminal open |
| `exit` | Container se bahar aao |
| `docker ps` | Running containers list show |
| `docker ps -a` | All containers (running + stopped) show |
| `docker stop <container_id>` | Running container ko stop karo |
| `docker rm <container_id>` | Stopped container ko delete karo |
| `docker rmi <image_id>` | Docker image ko delete karo |
| `docker build -t <image_name> .` | Apne code ki Docker image banao |
| `docker run -p 8080:3000 <image_name>` | Port mapping ke sath container run karo |



How Docker Works (Steps) Table


Markdown
| Step | Process |
| :--- | :--- |
| **1** | User command deta hai |
| **2** | Docker CLI command receive karta hai |
| **3** | CLI request daemon ko bhejta hai |
| **4** | Daemon image check karta hai |
| **5** | Missing image Docker Hub se download hoti hai |
| **6** | Container create hota hai |
| **7** | Application run hoti hai